---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';import HowItWorks from '../../components/HowItWorks.astro';import learning from '../../data/learning.json';import '../../styles/app.css';import Map from '../../components/Map.astro';import {places} from '../../data/content.json';export function getStaticPaths(){return places.map(place=>({params:{id:place.id},props:{place}}));}const {place}=Astro.props;const p=place.passage;const nextApp=learning.related[0];
---
<Shell title={place.name}><a class="back-link" href="/">← All places</a><section class="intro"><span class="motif" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1>{place.name}</h1> <p>{place.kind} · Quran {p.ref}</p></section><div class="workspace"><section><article class="panel bottom-gap"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Quran {p.ref}</h2> <a href={p.translationUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read context ↗</a></div> <div class="panel-body"><p>{place.summary}</p><p class="arabic" lang="ar" dir="rtl">{p.arabic}</p><blockquote class="source-quote">{p.translation}</blockquote><p class="micro">Marmaduke Pickthall</p><a href={place.commentaryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Al-Tafsir al-Muyassar ↗</a><p class="micro">Place summary is an original concise paraphrase of the cited reading/commentary.</p></div></article>{place.point&&<section class="panel panel-body"><Map focus={place.id}/><a href={place.geoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Coordinate source: {place.geoLabel} ↗</a><p class="micro">Marker: {place.point[1].toFixed(4)}°N, {place.point[0].toFixed(4)}°E. Display precision is not historical site precision.</p></section>}<div id="session-end" data-name={place.name} data-ref={p.ref} data-id={place.id} data-note={place.point?'A pin shows a modern city or heritage context, not an exact event site.':'A place without a pin has no defensible modern location in its sources.'} data-next-name={nextApp.name} data-next-url={nextApp.url}></div></section> <aside class="sidebar"><HowItWorks><p>Read the passage first, then the location note. A pin, where there is one, shows a modern city or heritage context, not a reconstructed Quranic event site.</p><p>Bookmarks are optional and stay in this browser for up to 30 days.</p></HowItWorks><div class="notice"><h2>What the map can establish</h2> <p>{place.note}</p>{!place.point&&<p>No coordinate has been assigned to this place.</p>}</div> <div class="panel panel-body"><button class="button secondary wide" data-save={place.id} aria-pressed="false">Save</button><p class="micro top-gap">Bookmarks are optional and stay in this browser for up to 30 days.</p><button class="text-button" data-print>Print this place</button></div></aside></div><script>import '../../lib/library';import '../../lib/place-end';</script></Shell>
